      "id": "claim_e84ba777a3b44ff588053b4953c48633",
      "statement": "Configuration is read per-module via load_dotenv and os.getenv/os.environ.get at import time (db, jwt, security, executor, ssh_client, mcp) rather than through a central settings module, so environment changes require a process restart to take effect.",
