      "statement": "API_KEY_SECRET has no default: get_fernet_cipher raises RuntimeError at security module import when it is unset, which aborts application startup before the server can bind, making it a hard deployment requirement unlike JWT_SECRET which silently falls back to dev-ops-mcp.",
